  "notes": "Indofood Sukses Makmur (INDF) — IDX-listed parent of the Salim Group's food empire. Group consolidates: ICBP (CBP — packaged food/instant noodles, owns ~80%), Bogasari (flour milling), SIMP (Salim Ivomas Pratama palm oil + sugar, owns ~76% via IndoAgri SG), and Distribution. World's largest instant-noodle producer (Indomie brand). Reports under PSAK in IDR-millions. FY history sourced from indofood.com group-level annual reports (2019-2024). Largest segments by revenue: CBP (~60% post-Pinehill consol from 2020), Agribusiness (~15%), Bogasari (~17%), Distribution (~8%). Net debt ballooned in 2020 from US$2.05B Pinehill (Africa/MENA noodles) acquisition financing. Group EBITDA ~Rp22-23T at FY2024.",
